t forth to meet the Philistine; and he cursed me by his idols."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["But I drew his own sword, and beheaded him, and removed reproach from the children of Israel."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":269,"caller":"+","text":"Alex. Goliath.","reference":{"chapter":151,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/151.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PRO/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/150.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}